/// @defgroup grp_core Engine lifecycle
/// Create, run and destroy the engine, plus window setup.

/// @defgroup grp_module Modules and systems
/// Register modules, systems and phases; access the EnTT registry and events.

/// @defgroup grp_comps Built-in components
/// The components the engine understands out of the box: transform, camera_2d, camera_on, sprite,
/// sprite_anim, scene_owned, child_of.

/// @defgroup grp_time Time
/// Frame time and elapsed time.

/// @defgroup grp_camera Camera
/// The active camera and converting coordinates between world and screen.

/// @defgroup grp_input Input
/// Keyboard keys and actions.

/// @defgroup grp_shader Shader
/// Load shaders, set uniforms (arrays included), attach extra images, turn shaders on and off while drawing.

/// @defgroup grp_instancing Instancing
/// Draw thousands of identical shapes with one draw call, each with a little data of its own.

/// @defgroup grp_texture Texture
/// Load and draw textures from image files.

/// @defgroup grp_render_texture Render texture
/// Off-screen images to draw into, used for post-processing.

/// @defgroup grp_sound Sound
/// Short sounds loaded into memory: effects, overlapping playback, pitch, looping.

/// @defgroup grp_music Music
/// Music streamed from disk: background music, long ambient sounds.

/// @defgroup grp_log Log
/// Log by level, redirect where the log goes.

/// @defgroup grp_draw Drawing shapes
/// Rectangles, circles, lines, triangles; blend modes and scissoring.

/// @defgroup grp_text Text and fonts
/// Draw text, measure text, load fonts with Vietnamese support.

/// @defgroup grp_tilemap Tilemap
/// A grid of cells split into chunks, with no size limit, and collision against the grid.

/// @defgroup grp_procgen Map generation
/// Noise, natural-map rules, top-down and platformer level generation, Wave Function Collapse.

/// @defgroup grp_scene Scene
/// Split the game into screens: menu, playing, game over.

/// @defgroup grp_window Window and application
/// Quit the game, fullscreen, window size, mouse cursor.

/// @defgroup grp_file Files and save games
/// Read and write files and the user's save-game folder.

/// @defgroup grp_math Math
/// vec2 operations, rectangles, circles, interpolation, built-in colors.

/// @defgroup grp_collide Collision
/// Overlap tests and push-out between points, rectangles and circles.

/// @defgroup grp_random Random numbers
/// A reproducible random number generator.

/// @defgroup grp_tween Timers and tweens
/// Timers, easing curves and smooth value transitions.

/// @defgroup grp_anim Animation
/// Sprite sheets with clips, loading from Aseprite, animation state machines.

/// @defgroup grp_particles Particles
/// Particle emitters: explosions, dust, sparks, smoke, fire.

/// @defgroup grp_fx Effects (FX)
/// Camera shake, hitstop, screen flash, sprite flash and ready-made particle presets.

/// @defgroup grp_light 2D lighting
/// Point lights, spot lights, directional lights, ambient light, shadows from occluders, normal maps, physically based lights.

/// @defgroup grp_post Built-in post-processing
/// Bloom, vignette, CRT, color grading, blur and other ready-made effect sets.

/// @defgroup grp_collision Entity collision
/// Colliders, layers and masks, enter/stay/exit events, movement with obstacles, queries, raycasts.

/// @defgroup grp_prefab Prefab
/// Templates for creating entities, lookup by name, spawning as a child of another entity.

/// @defgroup grp_json JSON
/// Read and write JSON for save games and config files.

/// @defgroup grp_level Level
/// Load maps from Tiled and LDtk into entities, tilemaps and colliders.

/// @defgroup grp_reload Hot reload
/// Reload textures and shaders when the file changes, while the game is running.

/// @defgroup grp_ui UI
/// Panels, buttons, toggles, sliders, choices, popups, toasts; mouse, keyboard, gamepad; custom images and shaders.

/// @defgroup grp_debug Debug
/// The debug gateway for njin_inspector: metrics, entities, watches, log, time control.

/// @defgroup grp_body Characters
/// Platformer controller (coyote time, wall jump, slopes) and top-down controller (8 directions, dash), moving platforms.

/// @defgroup grp_nav Pathfinding
/// Grid, A*, line of sight and path following for enemies.

/// @defgroup grp_timer Per-entity timers and tweens
/// Run a function after a delay, repeat it, and smoothly tween an entity's position, scale and color.

/// @defgroup grp_i18n Localization
/// Per-language string tables, strings with parameters, fallback language.

/// @defgroup grp_dialog Dialog
/// Dialog scripts, character-by-character text, portraits, choices, events.

/// @defgroup grp_settings Settings
/// Save and load the player's volume, keys, fullscreen and language.

/// @defgroup grp_types Basic types
/// Integers, floats, vectors, colors and handles.
